<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="National Media - Political media intelligence firm with 750+ victories. We find the forgotten 50% of voters that receive only 6% of impressions.">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/shared.css">
    <style>
        /* Page-specific styles for Problem page */
        
        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + 48px);
            padding-bottom: 64px;
            position: relative;
            background: #F8F9FA;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background-image: 
                repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 100px, rgba(8, 48, 80, 0.008) 100px, rgba(8, 48, 80, 0.008) 100.5px),
                repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent, transparent 100px, rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.005) 100px, rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.005) 100.5px);
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        
        .hero__content {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .hero__label {
            font-size: 0.813rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            color: var(--red-primary);
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s var(--ease-out-expo) 0.2s forwards;
        }
        
        .hero__title {
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--navy-primary);
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeInUp 1s var(--ease-out-expo) 0.4s forwards;
        }
        
        .hero__subtitle {
            font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 2.25vw, 1.875rem);
            color: var(--gray-600);
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-bottom: 64px;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s var(--ease-out-expo) 0.6s forwards;
            line-height: 1.45;
        }
        
        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            to { opacity: 1; }
        }
        
        /* Statistics */
        .hero__stats {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: stretch;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto 64px;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeIn 1s var(--ease-out-expo) 1s forwards;
            border: 2px solid #E8EBF0;
            background: white;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(8, 48, 80, 0.04);
        }
        
        .hero__stat {
            flex: 1;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 48px 32px;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .hero__stat:first-child {
            border-right: 2px solid #E8EBF0;
        }
        
        .hero__stat-value {
            font-size: clamp(6rem, 10vw, 8rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 0.9;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            color: var(--navy-primary);
        }
        
        .hero__stat--secondary .hero__stat-value {
            color: var(--red-primary);
        }
        
        .hero__stat-label {
            font-size: 0.813rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            color: var(--gray-500);
            font-weight: 700;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        
        .hero__stat-sublabel {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--gray-500);
            line-height: 1.4;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        /* Audience Divide Visualization */
        .audience-divide {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto 64px;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out 1.5s forwards;
        }
        
        .audience-divide__container {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FCFCFD 0%, white 100%);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 32px;
            border: 2px solid #E8EBF0;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(8, 48, 80, 0.04);
        }
        
        .audience-divide__grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
            gap: 32px;
            align-items: stretch;
        }
        
        .voter-half__bar {
            height: 60px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F5F6F8 0%, #FAFBFC 100%);
            border-radius: 4px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            border: 1px solid #DFE2E7;
            width: 100%;
        }
        
        .voter-half__bar-fill {
            height: 100%;
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 0;
            border-radius: 3px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            padding-right: 16px;
        }
        
        .voter-half--saturated .voter-half__bar-fill {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy-primary) 0%, #0A4A6E 100%);
        }
        
        .voter-half--forgotten .voter-half__bar-fill {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red-primary) 0%, #E63946 100%);
            transition: width 1.5s var(--ease-out-expo) 0.5s;
        }
        
        .voter-half__value {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: white;
        }
        
        .voter-half--forgotten .voter-half__value {
            position: absolute;
            right: 16px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            color: var(--red-primary);
        }
        
        .voter-half__dots {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(10, 1fr);
            gap: 7px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            padding: 12px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 0%, rgba(8, 48, 80, 0.01) 100%);
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        
        .voter-dot {
            width: 11px;
            height: 11px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #E8EAED;
            opacity: 0.3;
        }
        
        .voter-dot--active {
            background: var(--navy-primary);
            opacity: 1;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(8, 48, 80, 0.2);
        }
        
        .voter-half--forgotten .voter-dot {
            background: #FFD4D4;
            opacity: 0.5;
        }
        
        .audience-divide__center {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .audience-divide__line {
            width: 2px;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, var(--gray-300) 10%, var(--gray-300) 90%, transparent);
            position: absolute;
        }
        
        .audience-divide__label {
            background: white;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            color: var(--gray-400);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
            border-radius: 20px;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        
        .voter-half__label {
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .voter-half__label-main {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            color: var(--navy-primary);
        }
        
        .voter-half__label-sub {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--gray-500);
        }
        
        .audience-divide__caption {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 32px;
            padding-top: 32px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
        }
        
        .audience-divide__caption p {
            font-size: 1.125rem;
            color: var(--gray-600);
        }
        
        .underline-scroll {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--red-primary);
        }
        
        /* Insight Section */
        .insight {
            padding: 100px 0;
            background: var(--gray-50);
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .insight::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background-image: 
                repeating-linear-gradient(115deg, transparent, transparent 100px, rgba(8, 48, 80, 0.015) 100px, rgba(8, 48, 80, 0.015) 101px),
                repeating-linear-gradient(-115deg, transparent, transparent 100px, rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.01) 100px, rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.01) 101px);
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        
        .insight__content {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .insight__label {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            color: var(--cyan-dark);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        
        .insight__title {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--navy-primary);
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            line-height: 1.15;
        }
        
        .insight__text {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: var(--gray-600);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 64px;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }
        
        .insight__text strong {
            color: var(--navy-primary);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        
        .margin-comparison {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: stretch;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 64px auto;
        }
        
        .margin-item {
            flex: 1;
            text-align: center;
            background: white;
            padding: 48px 24px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: 2px solid #E8EBF0;
            border-right: none;
        }
        
        .margin-item:last-child {
            border-right: 2px solid #E8EBF0;
        }
        
        .margin-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
            z-index: 10;
            border-color: var(--cyan-primary);
        }
        
        .margin-item__value {
            display: block;
            font-size: 2.25rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--gray-600);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        
        .margin-item--featured {
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .margin-item--featured::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 4px;
            background: var(--red-primary);
        }
        
        .margin-item--featured .margin-item__value {
            font-size: 3.75rem;
            color: var(--red-primary);
        }
        
        .margin-item__label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            color: var(--gray-500);
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        
        .margin-item--featured .margin-item__label {
            color: var(--navy-primary);
        }
        
        .margin-item__context {
            display: block;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            color: var(--gray-400);
        }
        
        .margin-item--featured .margin-item__context {
            color: var(--red-primary);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        
        .insight__emphasis {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--navy-primary);
            margin-top: 32px;
        }
        
        .insight__emphasis span {
            font-size: 1.125rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: var(--gray-600);
            display: block;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }
        
        /* Timeline Section */
        .timeline {
            padding: 100px 0;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, white 0%, var(--gray-50) 100%);
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .timeline__header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 64px;
        }
        
        .timeline__label {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            color: var(--cyan-dark);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        
        .timeline__title {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--navy-primary);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        
        .timeline__description {
            font-size: 1.125rem;
            color: var(--gray-600);
        }
        
        .timeline__container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            position: relative;
            padding-top: 80px;
        }
        
        .timeline__track {
            height: 3px;
            background: var(--gray-200);
            position: absolute;
            top: 40px;
            left: 5%;
            right: 5%;
        }
        
        .timeline__progress {
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cyan-primary) 0%, var(--cyan-dark) 33%, var(--navy-primary) 66%, var(--red-primary) 100%);
            width: 0;
            transition: width 2s var(--ease-out-expo);
        }
        
        .timeline__phases {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 24px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        
        .timeline-phase {
            text-align: center;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.6s var(--ease-out-expo) forwards;
        }
        
        .timeline-phase:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.8s; }
        .timeline-phase:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 1.0s; }
        .timeline-phase:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 1.2s; }
        .timeline-phase:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 1.4s; }
        
        .timeline-phase__marker {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background: white;
            border: 3px solid var(--cyan-primary);
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin: -40px auto 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
            transition: all var(--transition-base);
        }
        
        .timeline-phase--victory .timeline-phase__marker {
            border-color: var(--red-primary);
            background: var(--red-primary);
        }
        
        .timeline-phase__number {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--cyan-primary);
        }
        
        .timeline-phase--victory .timeline-phase__number {
            color: white;
        }
        
        .timeline-phase:hover .timeline-phase__marker {
            transform: scale(1.15);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.2);
        }
        
        .timeline-phase__card {
            background: white;
            padding: 24px 16px;
            margin-top: 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
            transition: all var(--transition-base);
        }
        
        .timeline-phase:hover .timeline-phase__card {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
            border-color: var(--cyan-primary);
        }
        
        .timeline-phase__title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--navy-primary);
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        
        .timeline-phase__days {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            color: var(--gray-500);
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        
        .timeline-phase__actions {
            list-style: none;
            text-align: left;
        }
        
        .timeline-phase__action {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: var(--gray-600);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            padding-left: 16px;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .timeline-phase__action::before {
            content: '→';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: var(--cyan-primary);
        }
        
        .timeline-phase__action strong {
            color: var(--navy-primary);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        
        .timeline-phase--victory .timeline-phase__action strong {
            color: var(--red-primary);
        }
        
        /* Case Study Section */
        .case-study {
            padding: 100px 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--slate-700) 0%, var(--slate-800) 100%);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .case-study::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background-image: 
                repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 40px, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 40px, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 41px),
                repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent, transparent 40px, rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.025) 40px, rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.025) 41px);
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        
        .case-study__header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 64px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .case-study__label {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: white;
            background: var(--cyan-primary);
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 10px 24px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        
        .case-study__title {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3.2rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            color: white;
            line-height: 1.15;
        }
        
        .case-study__stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 64px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .case-stat {
            padding: 48px 24px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04) 100%);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        
        .case-stat:nth-child(3) {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.15) 0%, rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.08) 100%);
            border-color: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.3);
        }
        
        .case-stat:nth-child(3) .case-stat__value {
            color: #FF6B6B;
        }
        
        .case-stat:nth-child(4) {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.15) 0%, rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.08) 100%);
            border-color: rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.3);
        }
        
        .case-stat:nth-child(4) .case-stat__value {
            color: var(--cyan-light);
        }
        
        .case-stat:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        
        .case-stat__label {
            font-size: 11px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: block;
        }
        
        .case-stat__value {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: white;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            transition: all var(--transition-base);
        }
        
        .case-stat:hover .case-stat__value {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
        
        .case-stat__sublabel {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
        }
        
        .case-study__result {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.95) 0%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.98) 100%);
            border: 2px solid rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.2);
            padding: 64px;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
            gap: 64px;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.1), 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .case-study__result::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--cyan-primary), transparent);
        }
        
        .case-study__result-content h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: white;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        
        .case-study__result-content p {
            font-size: 1.125rem;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        
        .case-study__result-content p strong {
            color: var(--cyan-primary);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        
        .case-study__result-metric {
            text-align: center;
            padding-left: 32px;
            border-left: 2px solid rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.2);
            min-width: 200px;
        }
        
        .case-study__result-number {
            font-size: 4.5rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--cyan-primary);
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.4);
        }
        
        .case-study__result-label {
            font-size: 11px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        
        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .timeline__phases { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); row-gap: 48px; }
            .timeline__track { display: none; }
            .case-study__stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .case-study__result { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; padding: 48px; }
            .case-study__result-metric { padding-left: 0; padding-top: 24px; border-left: none; border-top: 2px solid rgba(0, 174, 239, 0.2); }
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero__stats { flex-direction: row; }
            .hero__stat { padding: 32px 16px; }
            .hero__stat:first-child { border-right: 2px solid #E8EBF0; border-bottom: none; }
            .hero__stat-value { font-size: clamp(3rem, 12vw, 5rem); }
            .audience-divide__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }
            .audience-divide__center { display: none; }
            .voter-half { padding: 16px; }
            .voter-half--saturated { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-200); }
            .margin-comparison { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 0; border: 2px solid #E8EBF0; }
            .margin-item { border: none; border-right: 1px solid #E8EBF0; border-bottom: 1px solid #E8EBF0; }
            .margin-item--featured { grid-column: span 2; order: -1; border-right: none; }
            .margin-item:nth-child(1) { border-right: 1px solid #E8EBF0; border-bottom: none; }
            .margin-item:nth-child(3) { border-right: none; border-bottom: none; }
            .timeline__phases { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-left: 60px; }
            .timeline-phase__marker { position: absolute; left: -60px; top: 0; margin: 0; }
            .case-study__stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .hero__stats { flex-direction: column; }
            .hero__stat:first-child { border-right: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #E8EBF0; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="hero__content">
                <p class="hero__label">THE PROBLEM NO ONE TALKS ABOUT</p>
                <h1 class="hero__title">The country is divided.</h1>
                <p class="hero__subtitle">But not how you think.</p>
                
                <div class="hero__stats">
                    <div class="hero__stat hero__stat--primary">
                        <span class="hero__stat-value">94%</span>
                        <span class="hero__stat-label">OF YOUR SPEND REACHES</span>
                        <span class="hero__stat-sublabel">HALF YOUR AUDIENCE</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hero__stat hero__stat--secondary">
                        <span class="hero__stat-value">6%</span>
                        <span class="hero__stat-label">OF YOUR SPEND REACHES</span>
                        <span class="hero__stat-sublabel">THE OTHER HALF</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Audience Divide Visualization -->
                <div class="audience-divide">
                    <div class="audience-divide__container">
                        <div class="audience-divide__grid">
                            <!-- Left side - oversaturated -->
                            <div class="voter-half voter-half--saturated">
                                <div class="voter-half__bar">
                                    <div class="voter-half__bar-fill" style="width: 94%;">
                                        <span class="voter-half__value">94%</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voter-half__dots">
                                    <% for(let i = 0; i < 50; i++) { %>
                                    <span class="voter-dot voter-dot--active"></span>
                                    <% } %>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voter-half__label">
                                    <span class="voter-half__label-main">Easy to reach. Cheap to find.</span>
                                    <span class="voter-half__label-sub">Still customers. Still decision-makers.</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <!-- Center divider -->
                            <div class="audience-divide__center">
                                <div class="audience-divide__line"></div>
                                <div class="audience-divide__label">THE DIVIDE</div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <!-- Right side - forgotten -->
                            <div class="voter-half voter-half--forgotten">
                                <div class="voter-half__bar">
                                    <div class="voter-half__bar-fill" style="width: 6%;"></div>
                                    <span class="voter-half__value">6%</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voter-half__dots">
                                    <% for(let i = 0; i < 50; i++) { %>
                                    <span class="voter-dot"></span>
                                    <% } %>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voter-half__label">
                                    <span class="voter-half__label-main">Still customers. Still valuable.</span>
                                    <span class="voter-half__label-sub">Still drive growth.</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="audience-divide__caption">
                            <p>They're worth <span class="underline-scroll">more than 6% of your investment.</span></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    
    <!-- Insight Section -->
    <section class="insight" id="insight">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="insight__content">
                <p class="insight__label">THE INVISIBLE ADVANTAGE</p>
                <h2 class="insight__title">
                    When Margins Matter,<br>
                    Precision Is Everything
                </h2>
                <p class="insight__text">
                    <strong>We find the audiences that determine outcomes.</strong> 
                    In races decided by thousandths of a percent, in markets where every impression counts—we find who others can't.
                </p>
                
                <div class="margin-comparison">
                    <div class="margin-item">
                        <span class="margin-item__value">20-30%</span>
                        <span class="margin-item__label">Consumer Products</span>
                        <span class="margin-item__context">"Good Enough"</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="margin-item margin-item--featured">
                        <span class="margin-item__value">0.2%</span>
                        <span class="margin-item__label">Your Race</span>
                        <span class="margin-item__context">Life or Death</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="margin-item">
                        <span class="margin-item__value">10-15%</span>
                        <span class="margin-item__label">Corporate Boards</span>
                        <span class="margin-item__context">"Pretty Close"</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <p class="insight__emphasis">
                    We're the experts at the smallest margins on Earth.
                    <span>537 votes decided a presidency. We find every one.</span>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Timeline Section -->
    <section class="timeline" id="execution">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="timeline__header">
                <p class="timeline__label">HOW WE WON PENNSYLVANIA</p>
                <h2 class="timeline__title">120-Day Campaign Execution</h2>
                <p class="timeline__description">From zero to victory in 120 days. The playbook that delivered a 20-point reach advantage.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="timeline__container">
                <div class="timeline__track">
                    <div class="timeline__progress"></div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="timeline__phases">
                    <div class="timeline-phase">
                        <div class="timeline-phase__marker">
                            <span class="timeline-phase__number">01</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="timeline-phase__card">
                            <h3 class="timeline-phase__title">Research</h3>
                            <span class="timeline-phase__days">Pre-Campaign</span>
                            <ul class="timeline-phase__actions">
                                <li class="timeline-phase__action"><strong>1.2M</strong> voters analyzed</li>
                                <li class="timeline-phase__action"><strong>97%</strong> match rate achieved</li>
                                <li class="timeline-phase__action"><strong>Cross-screen</strong> media plan built</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="timeline-phase">
                        <div class="timeline-phase__marker">
                            <span class="timeline-phase__number">02</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="timeline-phase__card">
                            <h3 class="timeline-phase__title">Launch</h3>
                            <span class="timeline-phase__days">Week 1-4</span>
                            <ul class="timeline-phase__actions">
                                <li class="timeline-phase__action"><strong>All channels</strong> deployed</li>
                                <li class="timeline-phase__action"><strong>Broadcast, Cable, CTV, Audio</strong></li>
                                <li class="timeline-phase__action"><strong>Real-time</strong> tracking active</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="timeline-phase">
                        <div class="timeline-phase__marker">
                            <span class="timeline-phase__number">03</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="timeline-phase__card">
                            <h3 class="timeline-phase__title">Optimize</h3>
                            <span class="timeline-phase__days">Week 5-8</span>
                            <ul class="timeline-phase__actions">
                                <li class="timeline-phase__action"><strong>35%</strong> missing targets found</li>
                                <li class="timeline-phase__action"><strong>Retrafficked</strong> unexposed HHs</li>
                                <li class="timeline-phase__action"><strong>Identity expansion</strong> via clean room</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="timeline-phase timeline-phase--victory">
                        <div class="timeline-phase__marker">
                            <span class="timeline-phase__number">04</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="timeline-phase__card">
                            <h3 class="timeline-phase__title">Victory</h3>
                            <span class="timeline-phase__days">Week 9-12</span>
                            <ul class="timeline-phase__actions">
                                <li class="timeline-phase__action"><strong>261,847</strong> exclusives</li>
                                <li class="timeline-phase__action"><strong>80.3%</strong> our reach</li>
                                <li class="timeline-phase__action"><strong>16,000</strong> vote win</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Case Study Section -->
    <section class="case-study" id="case-study">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="case-study__header">
                <p class="case-study__label">THE PROOF: PENNSYLVANIA 2024</p>
                <h2 class="case-study__title">
                    Outspent 8-to-1.<br>
                    Won By Finding the Forgotten Half.
                </h2>
            </div>
            
            <div class="case-study__stats">
                <div class="case-stat">
                    <div class="case-stat__label">Exclusive Voters</div>
                    <div class="case-stat__value">261,847</div>
                    <div class="case-stat__sublabel">Found and reached alone</div>
                </div>
                <div class="case-stat">
                    <div class="case-stat__label">Solo Coverage</div>
                    <div class="case-stat__value">25%</div>
                    <div class="case-stat__sublabel">Saw only our message</div>
                </div>
                <div class="case-stat">
                    <div class="case-stat__label">Our Total Reach</div>
                    <div class="case-stat__value">80.3%</div>
                    <div class="case-stat__sublabel">With 1/8 the budget</div>
                </div>
                <div class="case-stat">
                    <div class="case-stat__label">Their Reach</div>
                    <div class="case-stat__value">58.9%</div>
                    <div class="case-stat__sublabel">With 8x spending</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="case-study__result">
                <div class="case-study__result-content">
                    <h3>The 261,847 That Changed Everything</h3>
                    <p>
                        <strong>One quarter of our audience saw only our message.</strong> No opponent noise. No saturation. 
                        In a race decided by 16,000 votes, those 261,847 exclusive impressions weren't just important—they were the difference between victory and defeat.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="case-study__result-metric">
                    <div class="case-study__result-number">21%</div>
                    <div class="case-study__result-label">REACH ADVANTAGE</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

    <script>
        // Navbar scroll effect
        window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
            const navbar = document.getElementById('navbar');
            if (window.scrollY > 50) {
                navbar.classList.add('scrolled');
            } else {
                navbar.classList.remove('scrolled');
            }
        });
        
        // Animate timeline progress bar
        const timelineObserver = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
            entries.forEach(entry => {
                if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                    const progress = entry.target.querySelector('.timeline__progress');
                    if (progress) {
                        progress.style.width = '100%';
                    }
                }
            });
        }, { threshold: 0.2 });
        
        const timelineTrack = document.querySelector('.timeline__track');
        if (timelineTrack) {
            timelineObserver.observe(timelineTrack);
        }
        
        // Smooth scroll for anchor links
        document.querySelectorAll('a[href^="#"]').forEach(anchor => {
            anchor.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
                e.preventDefault();
                const target = document.querySelector(this.getAttribute('href'));
                if (target) {
                    target.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
                }
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>


